  "title": "David Perla on The Future Is Bright Podcast",
  "summary": "As technology accelerates change across the legal sector, law firm leaders are being forced to rethink everything from talent pipelines and workforce planning to growth strategies and firm financing. On The Future Is Bright podcast, Burford Vice Chair David Perla discusses how AI, permanent capital and shifting market dynamics are challenging long-held assumptions about how law firms grow, compete and prepare for the future. Learn more.",
